findings.suggestion:
Use length-prefix encoding or a delimiter that cannot appear in any component:

```go
// Length-prefix (safe against any character):
return fmt.Sprintf("%s.perm\x00%d:%s\x00%d:%s\x00%d:%s\x00%d:%s",
    namespace, len(userUID), userUID, len(action), action,
    len(name), name, len(parent), parent)
```

Or use a delimiter outside the valid UID charset (e.g. `\x00`), since `validUIDCharPattern` excludes it.
